45","title":"Have approved installation, maintenance and testing program for fire alarm systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0812":{"code":"F-0812","title":"Procure food from sources approved or considered satisfactory and store, prepare, distribute and serve food in accordance with professional standards.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0909":{"code":"F-0909","title":"Regularly inspect all bed frames, mattresses, and bed rails (if any) for safety; and all bed rails and mattresses must attach safely to the bed frame.","category":"Environmental Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0605":{"code":"F-0605","title":"Prevent the use of unnecessary psychotropic medications or use medications that may restrain a resident's ability to function.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0609":{"code":"F-0609","title":"Timely report suspected abuse, neglect, or theft and report the results of the investigation to proper authorities.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0610":{"code":"F-0610","title":"Respond appropriately to all alleged violations.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0684":{"code":"F-0684","title":"Provide appropriate treatment and care according to orders, resident’s preferences and goals.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0690":{"code":"F-0690","title":"Provide appropriate car